cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TextMapReady Terms: directed text mining of PDF reports for VOSviewer"
abstract: "Browser-based tool (formerly PDFTerms) that counts a user-defined controlled vocabulary across PDF reports, maps term co-occurrence and exports the network to VOSviewer. Files are processed locally and never uploaded."
authors:
  - family-names: "Cunha"
    given-names: "Darliane Ribeiro"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2548-1237"
    affiliation: "Federal University of Maranhão (UFMA)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/darlianecunha/text-mining-directed"
url: "https://textmining2.vercel.app"
keywords:
  - text mining
  - bibliometrics
  - VOSviewer
  - co-occurrence network
  - content analysis
